WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A ring hangs from a thread. You hold it still. Then it begins to move.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Your hand may have moved without you feeling that you chose to move it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Chevreul investigated this puzzle long before anyone could measure brainwaves with modern tools.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The movement is an observation. The story about what caused it is an explanation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That's the question to ask of any meditation audio: what was actually tested?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try our free twelve-minute exercise, read the sources, and choose for yourself.
